{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/collections/income-tax-statistics-and-distributions","content_id":"5eb89a51-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","description":"Analysis of estimated Income Tax liabilities statistics.","details":{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The Income Tax liability tables in this series provide breakdowns of the number of Income Tax payers and Income Tax liabilities by age, sex, country and Government Office Region, marginal Income Tax rate, income source, and tax band.</p>\n\n<p>You can find tables for previous years on the <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://webarchive.nationalarchives.gov.uk/ukgwa/*/http://hmrc.gov.uk/stats/income_tax/menu.htm\">National Archives website</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"release-schedule\">Release schedule</h2>\n\n<p>These tables are published annually at schedules dictated by the release of new survey information for Income Tax payers and the publication of revised forecasts for the UK economy by the Office for Budget Responsibility.</p>\n\n<p>For the exact date of release please refer to the UK Statistics publication hub or refer to the scheduled updates section:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/statistics/announcements\">UK Statistics Publication Hub</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/statistics/schedule-of-updates-for-hmrcs-statistics\">National and official statistics - scheduled updates</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>From this year forward the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/tax-structure-and-parameters-statistics\">Tax structure and parameters statistics</a> will be published with the Income Tax liabilities statistics.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"New publication added: 'Income Tax liabilities statistics: tax year 2023 to 2024 to tax year 2026 to 2027' and updated tables with new information for tax year 2026 to 2027.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-15T08:30:12Z"},{"note":"New publication added: 'Income Tax liabilities statistics: tax 